  * Selection: `HSEL`.
* Missing explicit statement that AHB has no AXI-style transaction IDs or arbitrary outstanding queues.
* Missing zero-wait throughput explanation: after pipeline fill, one transfer can complete per cycle.
* Missing wait-state domino effect and phase ownership.
* Missing Design obligations: registered control, response muxing, default slave, and correct HREADY routing.
* Missing DV scenarios: back-to-back read/write, read-after-write, wait-state insertion, error response, reset interruption, and wrong-phase data association.
